        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I have two thoughts about this right now:\r\n- Unfortunately, the simple dimming of inactive windows (set slightly darker background) seems impossible under Base16 because background is already the darkest color (in dark color scheme).\r\n- If making transparent background is as much as disabling `Normal` highlight group, I am leaning towards adding `hi Normal guifg=NONE guibg=NONE` to documentation for that. Either as a separate call or inside autocommand for `ColorSchemePre` event.\r\n\r\nAm I missing something here?",
